  "title": "K-Dub&#39;s Sausage and Egg Casserole",
  "description": "A cheesy blend of sausage and eggs are baked between layers of store-bought crescent roll dough in this make-ahead breakfast casserole.",
  "authors": [
    "Kelly MacDonald"
  ],
